# Unsplash and Pexels both blanket-reject unauthenticated/bot traffic on
# these photo/photographer-credit links (401/403 depending on the request),
# which is not a broken link. lychee's --accept is global, not per-domain, so
# the only way to stop that from masking a real break elsewhere is to skip
# checking these domains rather than accept the code everywhere. See
# .github/workflows/links.yml for the matching --accept note.
unsplash\.com
pexels\.com
